    <string name="trace_tuto_step0">3 rules, that\'s all:\n1 fraudster per colour -- 1 per row\nand column -- never side by side</string>
    <string name="trace_tuto_step1">The pink zone has only one cell:\nthe fraudster must be there.\nDouble-tap to place it.</string>
    <string name="trace_tuto_step2">These cells can never\nhold a fraudster. Put an X\non the 3 lit cells.</string>
    <string name="trace_tuto_step3">1 fraudster per row, 1 per column:\neach in its place. Put an X on\nthe 3 lit cells.</string>
    <string name="trace_tuto_step4">Never side by side, not even\ndiagonally. Put an X on\nthe lit cells.</string>
    <string name="trace_tuto_step5">Row 2: only one free cell.\nThe fraudster must be there.\nDouble-tap to place it.</string>
    <string name="trace_tuto_step6">What if you get it wrong?\nDouble-tap the cell framed\nin red.</string>
    <string name="trace_tuto_step7">A 3rd tap erases.\nTap the cell again.</string>
    <string name="trace_tuto_step8_a">Only 2 fraudsters left.\nRow 3: only one free cell.\nDouble-tap it.</string>
    <string name="trace_tuto_step8_b">The last one: row 4!\nDouble-tap it.</string>
    <string name="trace_tuto_tap_again_place">One more tap to place it!</string>
    <string name="trace_tuto_tap_again">One more tap!</string>
    <string name="trace_tuto_tap_again_ellipsis">One more tap...</string>
    <string name="trace_tuto_done1">Good. 1 fraudster per colour.</string>
    <string name="trace_tuto_done2">There you go. Each X rules out a cell.\nFewer cells = easier\nto find the next one.</string>
    <string name="trace_tuto_done3">1 fraudster per row, 1 per column.\nThe X marks are your memory: off-limits.</string>
    <string name="trace_tuto_done4">Everything touching a fraudster\nis safe: mark it X.</string>
    <string name="trace_tuto_done5">Well played. The X marks narrow it down\nuntil only one possible cell\nis left. That\'s the whole idea.</string>
    <string name="trace_tuto_done6">Wrong spot: it was touching a fraudster.\n-1 life, -200 pts.</string>
    <string name="trace_tuto_done7">Erased. The cycle:\nempty, X, fraudster, empty.</string>
    <string name="trace_tuto_done8">Done. Every colour, every row,\nevery column has ITS fraudster.\nYour turn!</string>
    <string name="trace_tuto_tap_glowing_any">Tap a glowing cell</string>
    <string name="trace_tuto_tap_glowing">Tap the glowing cell</string>
